{"id":"6c535786457e5cab","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MFrame.md","title":"MFrame","display":"MFrame","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"MFrame","parameters":["e","w","r"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"MFrame"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>e</span><span>w</span><span>r</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：正规模态。有序参数：<code>e</code>、<code>w</code>、<code>r</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ MFrame e w r)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ MFlags e)\n  (and\n    (@ Nonempty w)\n    (and\n      (@ RelationOn w r)\n      (and\n        (forall z369 (implies (and (@ Num0 z369) (in z369 e)) (@ Reflexive w r)))\n        (and\n          (forall z370 (implies (and (@ Num1 z370) (in z370 e)) (@ Serial w r)))\n          (and\n            (forall z371 (implies (and (@ Num2 z371) (in z371 e)) (@ Symmetric w r)))\n            (and\n              (forall z372 (implies (and (@ Num3 z372) (in z372 e)) (@ Transitive w r)))\n              (and\n                (forall z373 (implies (and (@ Num4 z373) (in z373 e)) (@ Euclidean w r)))\n                (forall z374 (implies (and (@ Num5 z374) (in z374 e)) (and (@ Transitive w r) (@ ConverseWF w r))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3695560d61c84d4f\" href=\"?note=3695560d61c84d4f\" title=\"ZFC_ConverseWF\">ConverseWF</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a7cb4c7dcf68166e\" href=\"?note=a7cb4c7dcf68166e\" title=\"ZFC_Euclidean\">Euclidean</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"84cd239bcd7aaf85\" href=\"?note=84cd239bcd7aaf85\" title=\"ZFC_MFlags\">MFlags</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fe68ff8d3284eeda\" href=\"?note=fe68ff8d3284eeda\" title=\"ZFC_Nonempty\">Nonempty</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e8cec2782b4668b5\" href=\"?note=e8cec2782b4668b5\" title=\"ZFC_Num0\">Num0</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6abf464803506304\" href=\"?note=6abf464803506304\" title=\"ZFC_Num1\">Num1</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36fc33b3a64f5aa9\" href=\"?note=36fc33b3a64f5aa9\" title=\"ZFC_Num2\">Num2</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"328ced6f64afa4d9\" href=\"?note=328ced6f64afa4d9\" title=\"ZFC_Num3\">Num3</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c1ad8f9bcce839f2\" href=\"?note=c1ad8f9bcce839f2\" title=\"ZFC_Num4\">Num4</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"4d9e65230522894e\" href=\"?note=4d9e65230522894e\" title=\"ZFC_Num5\">Num5</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"31def2a0ecebb8cf\" href=\"?note=31def2a0ecebb8cf\" title=\"ZFC_Reflexive\">Reflexive</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"cdb56d21d1bffdf8\" href=\"?note=cdb56d21d1bffdf8\" title=\"ZFC_RelationOn\">RelationOn</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"7630e048cda68443\" href=\"?note=7630e048cda68443\" title=\"ZFC_Serial\">Serial</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"9e9fc8d665281b83\" href=\"?note=9e9fc8d665281b83\" title=\"ZFC_Symmetric\">Symmetric</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"2b88fdcc29f28660\" href=\"?note=2b88fdcc29f28660\" title=\"ZFC_Transitive\">Transitive</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ MFrame e w r)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_ConverseWF","status":"resolved","id":"3695560d61c84d4f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_ConverseWF|ConverseWF]]；[[ZFC_Euclidean|Euclidean]]；[[ZFC_MFlags|MFlags]]；[[ZFC_Nonempty|Nonempty]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_Num2|Num2]]；[[ZFC_Num3|Num3]]；[[ZFC_Num4|Num4]]；[[ZFC_Num5|Num5]]；[[ZFC_Reflexive|Reflexive]]；[[ZFC_RelationOn|RelationOn]]；[[ZFC_Serial|Serial]]；[[ZFC_Symmetric|Symmetric]]；[[ZFC_Transitive|Transitive]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Euclidean","status":"resolved","id":"a7cb4c7dcf68166e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_ConverseWF|ConverseWF]]；[[ZFC_Euclidean|Euclidean]]；[[ZFC_MFlags|MFlags]]；[[ZFC_Nonempty|Nonempty]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_Num2|Num2]]；[[ZFC_Num3|Num3]]；[[ZFC_Num4|Num4]]；[[ZFC_Num5|Num5]]；[[ZFC_Reflexive|Reflexive]]；[[ZFC_RelationOn|RelationOn]]；[[ZFC_Serial|Serial]]；[[ZFC_Symmetric|Symmetric]]；[[ZFC_Transitive|Transitive]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_MFlags","status":"resolved","id":"84cd239bcd7aaf85","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_ConverseWF|ConverseWF]]；[[ZFC_Euclidean|Euclidean]]；[[ZFC_MFlags|MFlags]]；[[ZFC_Nonempty|Nonempty]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_Num2|Num2]]；[[ZFC_Num3|Num3]]；[[ZFC_Num4|Num4]]；[[ZFC_Num5|Num5]]；[[ZFC_Reflexive|Reflexive]]；[[ZFC_RelationOn|RelationOn]]；[[ZFC_Serial|Serial]]；[[ZFC_Symmetric|Symmetric]]；[[ZFC_Transitive|Transitive]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_